# Tourism Observatory — version-control rules
#
# Convention (README + data/manifest.json): data payloads are git-ignored and
# their provenance lives in data/manifest.json (SHA-256 at recording time).

# --- payloads -------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/*
data/processed/*

# WDPA is NOT redistributable (license) — hard deny ahead of any allowlist.
data/raw/WDPA_*
data/processed/wdpa_*
data/processed/*wdpa*

# Allowlist: small provenance / registry artifacts worth diffing.
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!data/processed/wayanad_boundary_32643.geojson
!data/processed/registry_homestays_wayanad_*.csv
!data/processed/registry_geocoded_*.csv
!data/processed/registry_geocoded_*.geojson
# P2 treatment-source records (small CSVs worth diffing; bulky GeoPackages stay ignored)
# NOTE: registry_classified_wayanad_*.csv is deliberately NOT allowlisted — it is a
# D-2 parsing intermediate whose only added field over the manifest source is a bulk
# scrape of ~111 `telephone` numbers from the tourism portal. Provenance for D-2 lives
# in data/manifest.json (source_url + snapshot note); the de-duplicated facility table
# (facility_universe / facility_existence_universe) carries facility_id ↔ source
# linkage without the contact-data payload.
!data/processed/facility_universe_*.csv
!data/processed/facility_existence_universe_*.csv
!data/processed/facility_existence_verdicts_*.csv

# Partial downloads
*.part

# --- generated QA artifacts (reproducible from data + scripts) ------------
outputs/qaqc/*
!outputs/qaqc/.gitkeep
# Exception: decision evidence that is NOT fully reproducible or that C2 must
# inspect without re-running — geocode logs hit external services (responses
# vary), the gate report/ingest facts are the record of the runs that passed.
!outputs/qaqc/geocode_log*.json
!outputs/qaqc/ingest_facts.json
!outputs/qaqc/baseline_qaqc_report.md
# P2: decision-facts that are NOT reproducible without re-running the ladder
# geocoder or re-inspecting imagery by eye. The un-ignore of the dir lifts the
# parent outputs/qaqc/* rule; the re-deny below keeps regenerable QA (rasters,
# quicklook PNGs, index CSVs) out of the repo; then the specific facts are
# re-allowed. Nested verdicts/ dir stays fully ignored (its content is bulky
# and the CSV verdict tables are tracked under data/processed/ instead).
!outputs/qaqc/
outputs/qaqc/*
!outputs/qaqc/p2_parcel_facts.json
!outputs/qaqc/p2_facility_universe_facts.json
!outputs/qaqc/p2_arm_labels_facts.json
!outputs/qaqc/p2_match_facts*.json
!outputs/qaqc/p2_match_balance*.json
# D-12 scar v2 digitization: calibration record (georeferencing anchors, fit
# residual, green-dot error) + the crown-corridor overlay used for visual QA.
# Kept because it is the evidence that the §4.4 scar sits at the published crown.
!outputs/qaqc/p2_scar_digitization_qa.json
!outputs/qaqc/p2_scar_digitization_overlay.png
# P3: H1 outcome-ingest facts (endpoint epochs, hashes, consistency checks incl.
# the GLAD-vs-WorldCover definitional caveat recorded under D-13). The ingest
# itself is reproducible from data + scripts, but the facts file pins what the
# run actually read (raw-tile sha256) and is the pre-analysis record.
!outputs/qaqc/p3_outcome_ingest_facts.json
# P3 hypothesis blocks: the five facts-of-record outputs (H1/H2a/H2b/H3/H4)
# and the H4 dispute read table. Data artifacts stay gitignored; these are
# the audited outcome records, also hash-pinned in PROJECTSTATE §9.
!outputs/qaqc/p3_h1_facts_2026-10-28.json
!outputs/qaqc/p3_h2a_facts_2026-10-28.json
!outputs/qaqc/p3_h2b_facts_2026-10-28.json
!outputs/qaqc/p3_h3_facts_2026-11-02.json
!outputs/qaqc/p4_h4_facts_2026-11-02.json
!outputs/qaqc/p4_h4_dispute_table_2026-11-02.csv
!outputs/qaqc/p3_h3_rainfall_sensitivity_2026-11-02.json
!outputs/qaqc/.gitkeep

# --- OS / python ------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.aux.xml
.DS_Store

# Playwright MCP session artifacts (browser traces/console dumps — never commit)
.playwright-mcp/
